    "title": "Rachel's Promise Adds 160 Beds as Homeless Women, Kids Flood San Diego Shelters - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kamal Jenkins ,\n5 hours ago A downtown San Diego shelter for homeless women and children just got a whole lot bigger. Rachel's Promise Center for Women and Children has expanded from 50 beds to 210, adding 160 new beds through a public-private partnership as the city scrambles to keep pace with a surge in families losing housing. Read full article\n5",
